---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { mailto, nowLabel } from '../data/site';
import Squiggle from '../components/Squiggle.astro';
import WorkflowDiagram from '../components/WorkflowDiagram.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout>
  <div class="border-b border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900/30">
    <blockquote class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-1 px-6 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between sm:gap-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-700 sm:text-base dark:text-stone-300">
        "We're here to put a dent in the universe."
      </p>
      <footer class="shrink-0 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">
        <cite class="not-italic">Steve Jobs</cite>
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-9 pb-12 sm:pt-11">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-amber-600 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">
          Research engineer · product builder
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
          I build AI systems that still work on the second Tuesday of the month.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
          I translate business outcomes into working solutions, investigate the uncertainty
          that stands in the way, and ship reliable applications from agentic systems to 3D perception.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
          I've always looked at the stars and wondered about our place in the universe. From
          both physical and spiritual perspectives, I keep returning to two questions: Who am I,
          and where do we go next as a civilization? I also love history, financial markets,
          geopolitics, and theology. I reset by running, hiking, or lifting; play football,
          cricket, and tennis; and unwind with sitcoms.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
          I'm also a firm believer in e/acc and in our ability to solve difficult problems when
          we set aside our differences and work toward becoming a Type I civilization on the
          Kardashev scale. AI and robotics will play a major role in that journey.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href={`${base}/projects`}
            class="rounded-md bg-stone-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-stone-700 dark:bg-amber-400 dark:text-stone-900 dark:hover:bg-amber-300"
          >
            Explore selected work →
          </a>
          <a
            href={`${base}/research`}
            class="rounded-md border border-stone-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-stone-900 hover:border-stone-500 dark:border-stone-700 dark:text-stone-100 dark:hover:border-stone-500"
          >
            Research questions
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <img
          src={`${base}/me.webp`}
          alt="Param Dave standing in front of a fog-covered Golden Gate Bridge."
          width="208"
          height="208"
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="h-44 w-40 rotate-2 rounded-[2px] border-[10px] border-b-[38px] border-white object-cover shadow-[0_10px_30px_-12px_rgb(0_0_0/0.45)] sm:h-52 sm:w-48 md:h-60 md:w-56 dark:border-stone-200"
        />
        <figcaption class="relative mt-7 max-w-[17rem] self-center text-stone-500 md:-ml-4 md:self-start dark:text-stone-400">
          <svg
            class="hidden h-9 w-9 -rotate-12 md:absolute md:-top-6 md:-left-7 md:block"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M3 21.5C4 14 8.5 8 15.5 5.2" />
            <path d="M15.5 5.2 9.6 6.2" />
            <path d="M15.5 5.2 14.2 11" />
          </svg>
          <span class="handwritten marker inline -rotate-2 text-[17px] text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-100">
            Golden Gate Bridge. Man, was it windy. 
            Photo: successful. Health: less so.
          </span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <WorkflowDiagram />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-9">
    <Squiggle class="mb-10" />
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-stone-500 uppercase">Now</h2>
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">{nowLabel}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] md:gap-12">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Shipping</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
          Agent eval harness design across multiple projects and 3D reasoning on outdoor imagery.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Investigating</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
          {[
            'How do you ground VLM and LLM reasoning through post-training, from PPO and GRPO to perception-aware objectives like PAPO?',
            'How do you make robotics policies generalize under conditions they were not trained for?',
            'How do you close the gap between inference benchmarks and production behavior?',
          ].map((question) => (
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2.5 inline-block h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span>{question}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-10">
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-stone-900 p-6 text-white sm:flex sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-10 sm:p-8 dark:bg-stone-100 dark:text-stone-900">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 dark:text-amber-600">
          My favorite kind of problem
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">
          The ones where the paper says 94% and your data says otherwise.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-300 dark:text-stone-600">
          I close that gap for a living — evaluation, post-training, and the model work
          underneath it. The application layer is downstream of getting that part right.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href={mailto}
        class="mt-5 inline-block shrink-0 rounded-md bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-stone-900 hover:bg-amber-300 sm:mt-0 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:text-white"
      >
        Start a conversation →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
